From db289b5a6a694fa458a315737f722bb085a4940b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lars Trieloff <lars@trieloff.net>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:17:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/16] tempfork/coder/websocket: coder/websocket v1.8.15's Go
 implementation, built for js/wasm too

Upstream compiles its Go WebSocket implementation only for !js and wraps
the browser's WebSocket under js/wasm. tsconnect's websocket() needs the
Go one there, on a net.Conn from the tailnet's dialer. The files are
upstream's non-test, non-js files with the !js constraints removed and
the internal import paths moved; see the README.
